---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`${site.name} is a cycling blog. Tours and travel by bike.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell about">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">A cycling blog</h1>
      <p class="lead">{site.tagline}</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>The Soul Searchers</strong> is a cycling blog. We write about riding bikes and
          using them to travel: a weekend overnighter, a bike on a German train, a coast road with
          salt on the bars.
        </p>
        <p>
          We care about the kilometres that open a town, a bakery, a language you are still learning.
          The bike is how we look at this planet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Here you will find <a href="/stories">ride stories</a> with pictures, and café stops that
          are part of the day. A turn that surprises you often becomes the best road of the tour.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          Clip in. Check the tyres. Look up from the stem. The planet is bigger than the cue sheet.
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          If a bike gets you down the tarmac, you are in the right place. Bring a pump and a little
          curiosity. See you on the road.
        </p>
        <p>
          A nod to the <a href="/friends">friends who helped along the ride</a>: cafés, shops, and
          people who made the kilometres kinder. Bike shops we trust live on
          <a href="/stores">Stores around the world</a>. Short notes on what happened sit under
          <a href="/week">This week</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          A small <a href="/shop">shop</a> too, in the background. Woven crest patches first,
          limited to 50. They are in production now and will arrive in about two weeks. Then
          they get sent out, worldwide. Want one? Drop Henrik an email.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/stories">The rides</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/shop">Shop</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/friends">Friends</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    color: rgba(238, 243, 247, 0.9);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
